Z||000000||sqoach||03-01-2001||07:41 PM||||(just in case you haven't seen this in the off-topic section)<P>what's up? ok, i'm about to by an amp kit from crutchfield, and i know you just got one. is it a pretty good kit? just need some input before i buy one.<P>also, it doesn't look like it has a water-proof fuse holder. how do you have yours to where it won't get rained on?<P><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||10
